<title>PHILIPPINES: Philex Mining Q1 net at 154.6 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Philex Mining Q1 net at 154.6 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philex Mining Corp said on Wednesday it posted a net profit of 154.6 million pesos in the first quarter of 1997, a turnaround from the 75 million-peso loss in the same period last year.</p>
</text>
